{
  "id": 193663405,
  "iid": 9067,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Extcap: Create our fifo in a temporary directory.",
  "description": "Instead of creating a temp file, unlinking it, and creating a fifo with\nthe same name, create a temporary directory and create a fifo inside\nthat.\n\nThis should avoid a race condition at least one antivirus package which,\nif the timing is right, will stat the initial temporary *file*, then\nopen and read from the *fifo*.\n\nAdd the unexpected magic number to a dumpcap error message.",
  "state": "merged",
